   "stem": {
      "text": "The function \\( f \\) has derivatives of all orders, with \\( f(1) = 1 \\), \\( f'(1) = 2 \\), \\( f''(1) = -2 \\), \\( f'''(1) = 6 \\). Let \\( g(x) = x^{2} f(x) \\). Find the second-degree Taylor polynomial for \\( g \\) about \\( x = 1 \\)."
   },
