   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "By the product rule, \\( g'(x) = 2 x f(x) + x^{2} f'(x) \\), and differentiating again, \\( g''(x) = 2 f(x) + 4 x f'(x) + x^{2} f''(x) \\).",
         "mathjson": 8
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "At \\( x = 1 \\): \\( g(1) = 1 \\), \\( g'(1) = 4 \\), \\( g''(1) = 8 \\).",
         "mathjson": 8
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "Divide by the factorials: the coefficients are \\( 1 \\), \\( 4 \\), and \\( \\frac{8}{2!} = 4 \\).",
         "mathjson": 4
      },
      {
         "step": 4,
         "text": "Stop at degree 2: \\( 1 + 4(x - 1) + 4(x - 1)^{2} \\).",
